1
00:00:00,146 --> 00:00:04,876
No, a friend would have told me
about the elevator.

2
00:00:07,753 --> 00:00:09,183
(Sheldon:)Look at me.

3
00:00:12,258 --> 00:00:16,658
(Sheldon:)I can get as close to you as I want without
my mom saying it's going to ruin my eyes.

4
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:22,255
Is, uh, he dangerous?

5
00:00:23,903 --> 00:00:26,303
(Leonard:)Actually, he's a genius.

6
00:00:26,572 --> 00:00:28,332
(Leonard:)I am.

7
00:00:29,408 --> 00:00:32,568
(Arthur:)That doesn't answer my question.

8
00:00:33,579 --> 00:00:37,019
Mr. Jeffries, I'm Leonard.
This is my girlfriend, Penny.

9
00:00:37,216 --> 00:00:39,976
(Penny:)- Hi.
- Hello.

10
00:00:42,655 --> 00:00:47,595
(Arthur:)Well, I hope I haven't, uh, kept the kids waiting
too long for the show.

11
00:00:47,827 --> 00:00:50,917
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, there are no kids.
No, the show's for me.

12
00:00:52,565 --> 00:00:55,095
Come on, I'll race you...

13
00:00:55,401 --> 00:01:01,021
(Sheldon(off):)...Arthur.

